    "shop_smart":  [
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eThe sausage is most of this recipe\u0027s cost.\u003c/strong\u003e Everything else combined runs about a third of it. This is the dish to make the week smoked sausage goes on sale.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eHeavy cream is the second line worth watching.\u003c/strong\u003e Two pints carries the batch. If you want it cheaper, evaporated milk gives you similar body for a fraction of the price.",
                       "\u003cstrong\u003eCanned corn is the cheapest thing on this list and it adds real sweetness.\u003c/strong\u003e Frozen works too. Either way it earns its place in the pot.",
